# HealthConnect Project Screenshots

This folder contains visual evidence of the HealthConnect appointment automation workflows.

Planned screenshots:
- `appointment-form.png` — Google Forms appointment request form.
- `google-sheets-status.png` — Google Sheets patient records and appointment status dropdown.
- `new-request-zap.png` — Zapier workflow for new appointment requests.
- `status-update-zap.png` — Zapier workflow for appointment status notifications.
- `approval-email.png` — Example approval email using fictional patient information.
- `decline-email.png` — Example decline email using fictional patient information.

All screenshots should use fictional test data and must not expose private patient information, email addresses, or API keys.
